  m_text: 'Shore Town

    A smaller, shore-side town that has significantly less
    resources and has been somewhat left up to it''s own fate. It is now scrambling
    for resources, as the ocean and the farm now cannot provide for them, alongside
    the bay village which can''t spread its resources to them over the giant fissure
    that seperates the villages.'
