  m_text: 'Main Tree

    The main centerpiece of the island and the source of so
    much of the island''s wealth of resources. It provided protection from the heat,
    absorbed an intense amount of CO2, provided food and even shelter. However, it
    was cut straight in half, and it has wrecked the island''s resources.'
